了，柑橘沁入湯底，與厚重的牛油味相互調和，前段有牛油溫潤的口感，後段柑橘味提上來帶入清爽以及甜味的感受，並增加了層次感，同時補上子洋蔥、松子及茴香，再搭配麵條所帶來的多重味道搭配，以及各種食材的層次感真的非常享受！ 牛板腱的部分相當軟嫩，熟度恰到好處，搭配生山葵的經典組合依然美味。",null,[0,30]]]],[null,1779703017000000,1779703017000000,"3 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfazMzemhvRUl3U3FmWWk2V3NYRHFUZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfazMzemhvRUl3U3FmWWk2V3NYRHFUZxoSQ2dzSTZiblEwQVlRbllMYkN3\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiPpoPkutKWAxXbcPUHHdUtN6gQ_2MIkAIoCA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16094878529001717020/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3Ym1GSFpFNVNSbFY1V2pBeFQwNXJiRUppV0VGNlpVVjBUbFV5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16094878529001717020/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3Ym1GSFpFNVNSbFY1V2pBeFQwNXJiRUppV0VGNlpVVjBUbFV5WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16094878529001717020/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3Ym1GSFpFNVNSbFY1V2pBeFQwNXJiRUppV0VGNlpVVjBUbFV5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16094878529001717020/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3Ym1GSFpFNVNSbFY1V2pBeFQwNXJiRUppV0VGNlpVVjBUbFV5WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16094878529001717020/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3Ym1GSFpFNVNSbFY1V2pBeFQwNXJiRUppV0VGNlpVVjBUbFV5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16094878529001717020/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3Ym1GSFpFNVNSbFY1V2pBeFQwNXJiRUppV0VGNlpVVjBUbFV5WXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝你願意給小店機會🙇\u200d♂️更是感謝好評回饋與分享🙏",null,[0,26]]]],[null,null,3416,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wbmFHZE5SRlV5WjAxT05rbEJiWEF6ZUV0TlUyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xf32b841d25339852!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmpnaGdNRFUyZ01ONklBbXAzeEtNU2c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https: